// tuple_key_in_dict_2(n): the JSON util `tuple-key-in-dict-2`, used where the JSON says `matches: "tuple-key-in-dict-2"`
//   D, K, K1, K2: metavariables this relation binds for the calling rule
.decl ruf019_tuple_key_in_dict_2(n: node, d: loc, k: loc, k1: loc, k2: loc)
ruf019_tuple_key_in_dict_2(n, D, K, K1, K2) :- kind(n, "comparison_operator"), n ~ `$K in $D`,
